        skos:altLabel          "steel 1m pipe dredge";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L19/current/SDNKG17/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L05/current/60/>;
        skos:definition        "A heavy-duty dredge consisting of a steel pipe where the make and model are unknown. The collection pipe is 1m length by 25cm diameter and made of 5mm thick steel. The dredge is towed through the target area collecting material from the bed. The pipe is 1 metre length, 25cm diameter and made of 5mm steel."@en;
