        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L05/current/LAB40/>;
        skos:definition        "A dispensing instrument for titrating and dosing operations in the laboratory. The instrument includes the following functions: pipetting, diluting and dispensing; calculation of results. Dispensing rates of between 0.001 mL/min and 150 mL/min can be selected alongside pippetting volumes of between 0.001 mL/min and 150 mL/min."@en;
