        skos:definition        "A cylinder (24 cm x 57.5 cm) contains a motor driven propellor and a flow meter.  Water is pushed into a net (20 cm diameter x 50 cm length with 100 ?m mesh attached to the rear end of the cylinder.. The system is used to sample under sea ice to depth of 10 m."@en;
