        skos:definition        "A 41 cm diameter mouth opening with frame 130 cm long.  Conical Monel mesh net with 30 meshes per cm. An unencased and scaled down version of the Gulf III described by Gehringer   [Wiebe and Benfield 2003 Plate 16 A]."@en;
