        skos:definition        "Digitron 2000 series are a range of hand-held digital thermometers. The 2028T model provides readings in seconds with an accuracy of 0.2 percent. Temperature measurements are available in Celsius or Fahrenheit with a temperature range of 200 degC to +1350 degC/ -328 degF to +2462 degF."@en;
