        skos:definition        "The UNIK 5000 is a bespoke pressure sensing unit that may be configured to user requirements. Ranges may be from 70 mbar to 700bar with an accuracy to +/-0.04 percent, frequency repsonse to 3.5 kHz and operating temperatures from -55 to +125 deg C."@en;
