        skos:definition        "The Vaisala WXT500 family includes the WXT510 and WXT520 weather transmitters. These suites measure barometric pressure, humidity, precipitation, temperature, wind speed and direction. The WXT510 is the earlier model, and the WXT520, with improved accuracy for some parameters."@en;
